      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the algorithm. The test verifies that encoding a string of only vowels and punctuation preserves just the leading vowel (uppercased), since the MRA algorithm strips punctuation, uppercases, then removes all vowels except the word-initial one.\n\nLet me write the improved test.The improved test compiled successfully."
